			"Message": "chore(Maintain): Refactor build script formatting and dependency organization\n\n- Standardize shell script redirection operators across maintenance scripts for consistency\n- Reorganize dependency JSON files into 'Inactive' directory, reflecting current build system requirements\n- Simplify JSON array formatting in organization configs to single-line structures\n- Update Vercel dependency references to align with new turbo module strategy\n\nThese changes improve maintainability of Land's build infrastructure by:\n1. Enforcing consistent scripting patterns in the Maintain component\n2. Clarifying active vs inactive dependencies for the bundler system\n3. Reducing unnecessary whitespace in configuration files\n4. Preparing dependency maps for future integration with Vercel's turbo module system\n\nThis refactoring supports the 'Rest' submodule's JS bundler requirements while maintaining compatibility with the current Cocoon sidecar architecture.",
